{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:82d68e4bcda7ab0af1bf306f3104c8ffcf2b9755c9ee328a17ebfedc4e3084f9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c66349870927b2f49a4b8d7df8b38829c678446d98a502db2017b68d3a95210",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，那件事我听说了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a36def58d63e7457a4f687cb6cab528c28a44e77e1a1e685e098d2fd85e72338",
      "text": "之前来外景的那位编辑，\n来联络了吧？对方说什么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b32bb482d127aee904f3d378593e37d72452fc55f1dd6811b1332c398b6bffe5",
      "text": "对方感谢我们，\n说做出了很棒的版面",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68166cdb46ea14da041f27a0ff641fcc3cf1ba11fea7dace9f37c8f21ba29991",
      "text": "哦哦！我还以为对方又遇到什么烦恼了呢，\n原来是做出了好东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:763f6d50e30ac2b640a519ff9238ae23e0ceb00a143e14e9c50116fae2ee69d7",
      "text": "毕竟那位编辑，之前看起来特别发愁、\n又特别拼命地在做杂志嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2022a9b597fffed2eda9dad6a91c7eab40cd62bc4f2fd48304302e227ef77312",
      "text": "一心想着对方要是困扰就想帮忙，不知不觉\n我自己也冒出了不少点子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f66afee42c186c680de7c91b5beb0a512dcf00cca85f6e6b2985302ba65b8d10",
      "text": "虽然七嘴八舌聊了好多，\n但要是能派上用场那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:094d53fb001d15c7265736b8a2ba8ebc5dee93418b839141fa0162097ad705e5",
      "text": "在艳阳下的海边拍摄，对我来说\n可能也是件好事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ede846e72d4239d579e00232397253ccacd7ce1c9dba8ca6a7fc67fa817b9c",
      "text": "我可是爆炎的朱雀！是绝不输给太阳的\n热血男子汉啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:025b7cee2ed2881c36f278cdfbe51bf2ecf18b5cb4c18c53c2a545760f760730",
      "text": "今后也继续展现\n火热的魅力吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9019a4d3afd3539a0612e8cd38acb773e09b0566c4ea06f6abcebaf517b0b494",
      "text": "傍晚拍摄时的表情\n也很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb3bc697195e1b703836e4b436c838fd531ca9aa1e8240b511c28869ff1cc19f",
      "text": "噢！只要有我能帮上忙的地方，\n无论什么我都上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5ccc978a155d672fc37f84d3c1fd0f74c07dea06e0b672812724e0ab64ffd02",
      "text": "这样啊！我自己倒是没太搞懂，\n回去把那本杂志再看一遍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_402_2_4_025_02_09_a:2_4_025_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d50272b91c9e3aa81b562cac72779322edd484f051f99f27e00da2c457ea26a",
      "text": "下一份工作我也会照这个势头全力以赴的，\n包在我身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
